# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day13

| Word        | Meaning    | Example                                               |
| ----------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| significant | 상당한, 중요한   | The discovery had a significant impact on science.    |
| emerge      | 나타나다, 등장하다 | New technologies emerge every year.                   |
| impact      | 영향         | Climate change has a major impact on the environment. |

---

## Synonyms

### significant

→ important / considerable

### emerge

→ appear / arise

### impact

→ effect / influence

